was significantly different between groups (p = 0.21, p = 0.31, respectively).']\n\nQuestion: Juvenile osteochondritis dissecans: is it a growth disturbance of the secondary physis of the epiphysis?\n\nOptions: \nA. yes\nB. no\nC. maybe\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
