    "global index": "NarrativeQA_7602",
    "prompt": "Please read the following context and answer the question based on its content.\n\nContext:  The story of the infernal rise of Ăvariste Gamelin, a young Parisian painter, involved in the section for his neighborhood of Pont-Neuf, The Gods Are Athirst describes the dark years of the Reign of Terror in Paris, from Year II to Year III. Fiercely Jacobin, Marat and Robespierre's most faithful adherent, Ăvariste Gamelin soon becomes a juror on the Revolutionary Tribunal.\nThe long, blind train of speedy trials drags this idealist into a madness that cuts off the heads of his nearest and dearest, and hastens his own fall as well as that of his mentor Robespierre in the aftermath of the Thermidorian Reaction. His love affair with the young watercolor-seller Ălodie Blaise heightens the terrible contrast between the butcher-in-training and the man who shows himself to be quite ordinary in his daily life.\nJustifying this dance of the guillotine by the fight against the plot to wipe out the gains of the Revolution, in the midst of the revolutionary turmoil that traverses Paris, Gamelin is thirsty for justice, but also uses his power to satisfy his own vengeance and his hatred for those who do not think like him. He dies by that same instrument of justice that up until then has served to satisfy his own thirst for blood and terror.\n\nQuestion: What club was Gamelin a member of?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{\\text{None}} The context does not specify which club Gamelin belonged to; it only identifies him as a fiercely Jacobin adherent of Marat and Robespierre. No specific club name, such as the Jacobin Club, is mentioned in the provided text. Therefore, the answer cannot be determined from the given information.",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 343,
        "output_tokens": 71,
        "total_tokens": 414
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "error": null
    },
    "cost": 6.790000000000001e-05,
    "accuracy": 0.0,
    "for_optimality": false
