    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The story does not explicitly state why women wear masks, but it suggests a dystopian society where women are harassed or threatened, so the masks likely serve as a means of anonymity or protection. The text refers to \"masked women\" and \"masked faces,\" implying that covering the face is a social norm in this future setting. Thus, the burka-like coverings are probably worn for safety or conformity in a hostile environment.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Women wear masks for anonymity or protection in a dystopian society where harassment is common.}}",
