      "generated_answer": "Based on the context, Dr. Capa travels to Los Angeles to restart his life after a patient’s suicide caused him to develop psychosomatic color blindness. He goes to stay with his friend and fellow therapist, Dr. Bob Moore, who invites him to sit in on a group therapy session. This move is meant to help him recover from his depression.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Dr. Capa travels to Los Angeles to restart his life after a patient's suicide.}}",
