      "generated_answer": "Lloyd, Bennett's wife, feels proud and supportive as she watches him set off on the expedition, recognizing it as his calling and duty. The text explicitly states that she \"rather proudly watches him go.\"\n\n\\boxed{She feels proud and supportive.}",
