      "generated_answer": "The quote highlights that religious worship was viewed differently depending on one’s role—as \"useful\" by the magistrate—which underscores its role in political stability and social order. Option H best captures this perspective by identifying the pragmatic, state-oriented value placed on religious practices in Roman governance. \n\n\\boxed{H}",
