    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The passage depicts 19th-century urban working women enduring extreme poverty, inadequate wages, and poor living conditions, which reflects the exploitation and struggle for survival characteristic of the industrial labor force. Option D provides the most accurate historical parallel, as the Industrial Revolution introduced similar systemic conditions of low-wage factory labor, harsh environments, and the economic desperation described by Jacob Riis. \n\n\\boxed{D}",
