    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The passage describes the U.S. intervention in Vietnam, which was fundamentally driven by the belief that the spread of communism had to be halted to prevent a chain reaction of fallen nations. This strategic foreign policy of the Cold War era is known as the Domino Theory.\n\n\\boxed{F}",
