      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumJumps(nums, target):\n    n = len(nums)\n    # dp[i] represents the maximum number of jumps to reach index i\n    # Initialize with -1 to indicate unreachable\n    dp = [-1] * n\n    dp[0] = 0  # Starting position requires 0 jumps\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        if dp[i] == -1:\n            continue  # Skip if we can't reach index i\n        \n        # Try jumping to all indices j > i\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            # Check if the jump condition is satisfied\n            if abs(nums[j] - nums[i]) <= target:\n                # Update dp[j] if this path gives more jumps\n                if dp[i] + 1 > dp[j]:\n                    dp[j] = dp[i] + 1\n    \n    return dp[n - 1]\n```",
