    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To minimize cost, we minimize the total cost function $ C = 2(2\\pi r^2) + 1.5(2\\pi r h) $ subject to the volume constraint $ \\pi r^2 h = 10 $. Solving using calculus yields the optimal radius $ r \\approx 1.061 $ ft and height $ h \\approx 2.828 $ ft. This matches option A exactly.\n\n$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$",
